{
  "title": "Four Kinds Of Sequence",
  "story": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "The frameworks read for [[Six Questions Five Pathways]] contain sequences of four genuinely different kinds. Flattening them into a single list of methods is the biggest error available here, because they are used at different moments and answer to different tests.",
      "id": "8ca0c977662fead4"
    },
    {
