er><marker id=\"mk3b82f6\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 Z\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/></marker><marker id=\"mkf59e0b\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 Z\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/></marker><marker id=\"mk8b5cf6\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 Z\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\"/></marker><marker id=\"mk7c3aed\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 Z\" fill=\"#7c3aed\"/></marker><marker id=\"mk6B4C9A\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 Z\" fill=\"#6B4C9A\"/></marker><marker id=\"mk8A5F10\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 Z\" fill=\"#8A5F10\"/></marker><marker id=\"mk2C5F8A\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 Z\" fill=\"#2C5F8A\"/></marker><marker id=\"mk0E5A4B\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 Z\" fill=\"#0E5A4B\"/></marker></defs>\n      \n      <g id=\"wardley-layer\"/>\n      <g id=\"lop-layer\"/>\n      <g id=\"lines-layer\"/>\n      <g id=\"edges-layer\"><g id=\"edge-c1\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>\ud83d\udccc A diagnostic run that passes its own steps but fails Beauty, Good, Truth or Economy has not succeeded.</title><path d=\"M340,126.93629929221436 Q272.2,146.2 204.0783460282916,282\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B4C9A\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" marker-end=\"url(#mk6B4C9A)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"272.20238974051557\" cy=\"145.3341890961957\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"checks\" href=\"/checks.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" pointer-events=\"none\" transform=\"rotate(-48.8,272.2,157.3)\"><tspan x=\"272.1692684471385\" y=\"157.33414338693885\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#6B4C9A\">checks</tspan></text></a></g><g id=\"edge-c2\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>\ud83d\udccc Production work that is efficient and ugly, or effective and untrue to its ecology, fails here regardless of delivery.</title><path d=\"M494.07834602829166,138 Q562.2,273.8 635,294.48432760364005\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B4C9A\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" marker-end=\"url(#mk6B4C9A)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"562.1513803579586\" cy=\"274.9963379261429\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"checks\" href=\"/checks.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" pointer-events=\"none\" transform=\"rotate(48.0,562.6,263.0)\"><tspan x=\"562.6386628176043\" y=\"263.00623551604974\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#6B4C9A\">checks</tspan></text></a></g><g id=\"edge-c3\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>\ud83d\udccc What gets taught is what gets repeated. A curriculum that transmits skill without the governing models propagates harm faster.</title><path d=\"M448.88,138 Q364.4,330 448.88,522\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B4C9A\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" marker-end=\"url(#mk6B4C9A)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"376.64\" cy=\"330\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"checks\" href=\"/checks.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" pointer-events=\"none\" transform=\"rotate(90.0,388.6,330.0)\"><tspan x=\"388.64\" y=\"330\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#6B4C9A\">checks</tspan></text></a></g><g id=\"edge-r1\" style=\"cursor: pointer; opacity: 1;\"><title>\ud83d\udccc The conditional branch. Cynefin's typing selects which production sequence is entered \u2014 complicated goes one way, complex another. This is why ROUTES_TO is a third relation and not containment.</title><path d=\"M305,330 L635,330\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8A5F10\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#mk8A5F10)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"470\" cy=\"356\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"ROUTES_TO\" href=\"/routesto.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" pointer-events=\"none\"><tspan x=\"470\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#8A5F10\">ROUTES_TO</tspan></text></a></g><g id=\"edge-q1\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>\ud83d\udccc Transmissibility, not confidence. Whether anyone present is certified in the skills this pathway needs \u2014 read off the SODOTO registry's Active / Ready / Candidate.</title><path d=\"M445.9216539717084,522 Q377.8,386.2 305,365.51567239635995\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2C5F8A\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk2C5F8A)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"377.84861964204146\" cy=\"385.00366207385713\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"qualifies\" href=\"/qualifies.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" pointer-events=\"none\" transform=\"rotate(48.0,377.4,397.0)\"><tspan x=\"377.3613371823957\" y=\"396.9937644839503\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#2C5F8A\">qualifies</tspan></text></a></g><g id=\"edge-q2\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>\ud83d\udccc A production pathway whose skills have no mentor can be run by its author and nobody else. That is a skill, not a method.</title><path d=\"M600,533.0637007077856 Q667.8,513.8 735.9216539717083,378\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2C5F8A\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk2C5F8A)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"667.7976102594844\" cy=\"514.6658109038043\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"qualifies\" href=\"/qualifies.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" pointer-events=\"none\" transform=\"rotate(-48.8,667.8,502.7)\"><tspan x=\"667.8307315528615\" y=\"502.6658566130611\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#2C5F8A\">qualifies</tspan></text></a></g><g id=\"edge-y1\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>\ud83d\udccc Step 16 of the 15 Ps. A finished production run abstracts what is universal and publishes it, which adds a teachable skill back into the registry. This is how the shelf grows.</title><path d=\"M635,365.51567239635995 Q562.2,386.2 494.07834602829166,522\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0E5A4B\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\" marker-end=\"url(#mk0E5A4B)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"562.1513803579586\" cy=\"385.0036620738571\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"Posterity \u2192 new pattern\" href=\"/posterity--new-pattern.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" pointer-events=\"none\" transform=\"rotate(-48.0,562.6,397.0)\"><tspan x=\"562.6386628176043\" y=\"396.99376448395026\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#0E5A4B\">Posterity \u2192 new pattern</tspan></text></a></g></g>\n      <g id=\"nodes-layer\"><g id=\"node-onto\" transform=\"translate(470,90)\" style=\"cursor: move; opacity: 1;\"><title>\ud83d\udccc Social Action Tetrahedron \u00b7 BGTE \u00b7 Optimum Sequence \u00b7 AIC.  \u2014  Not performed. A claim about how persons, ideals, orgs and actions necessarily relate, and about what makes their relating come to good. You check yourself against it and find which relation has failed.</title><polygon points=\"112.6,24.0 0.0,48.0 -112.6,24.0 -112.6,-24.0 -0.0,-48.0 112.6,-24.0\" fill=\"#F3EFFA\" stroke=\"#6B4C9A\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><circle cx=\"126\" cy=\"-44\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"ONTOLOGICAL\" href=\"/ontological.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#2E1F4A\" pointer-events=\"none\"><tspan x=\"0\" y=\"0.0\">ONTOLOGICAL</tspan></text></a></g><g id=\"node-diag\" transform=\"translate(180,330)\" style=\"cursor: move; opacity: 1;\"><title>\ud83d\udccc Systemic Problem Solving \u00b7 Cynefin \u00b7 Six Nested Questions \u00b7 Six Thinking Hats \u00b7 DSRP.  \u2014  A routing procedure. Takes an unclear situation and returns a type, a scale, and a decision about which production sequence to enter. The kind people most need and the kind least often written down.</title><rect x=\"-125\" y=\"-48\" width=\"250\" height=\"96\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E2ECE7\" stroke=\"#0E5A4B\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><circle cx=\"121\" cy=\"-44\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"DIAGNOSTIC\" href=\"/diagnostic.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#0B3B31\" pointer-events=\"none\"><tspan x=\"0\" y=\"0.0\">DIAGNOSTIC</tspan></text></a></g><g id=\"node-prod\" transform=\"translate(760,330)\" style=\"cursor: move; opacity: 1;\"><title>\ud83d\udccc 15 Ps \u00b7 Another Sequence of Tools \u00b7 Vester SensiMod \u00b7 System Discovery Process.  \u2014  Ordered work with resources, handoffs and deliverables. Looks like conventional method documentation and is the least transferable \u2014 each is fitted to a domain.</title><rect x=\"-125\" y=\"-48\" width=\"250\" height=\"96\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#F3EBDA\" stroke=\"#8A5F10\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"121\" cy=\"-44\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"PRODUCTION\" href=\"/production.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#513809\" pointer-events=\"none\"><tspan x=\"0\" y=\"0.0\">PRODUCTION</tspan></text></a></g><g id=\"node-curr\" transform=\"translate(470,570)\" style=\"cursor: move; opacity: 1;\"><title>\ud83d\udccc The six pathways already named in the SODOTO Skills Registry, plus the Systems Curriculum's four levels.  \u2014  A learning progression is not a work progression. CLD then Stock Flow then System Dynamics then Vester is how you ACQUIRE the practice; nobody would run a project in that order. This is the kind SODOTO actually certifies.</title><rect x=\"-130\" y=\"-48\" width=\"260\" height=\"96\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E7F0F7\" stroke=\"#2C5F8A\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"126\" cy=\"-44\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"CURRICULAR\" href=\"/curricular.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#1B3B57\" pointer-events=\"none\"><tspan x=\"0\" y=\"0.0\">CURRICULAR</tspan></text></a></g></g>\n      <g id=\"triples-layer\"/>\n      <g id=\"drag-layer\"/>\n      <g id=\"eip-statement-layer\"/>\n      \n      <g id=\"opm-symbols-chart\"/>\n    </svg>",
      "id": "1db8874dbdc994df"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "## Ontological",
      "id": "c6125dec4eb6c72c"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "What is true of ethical collective action. Not performed \u2014 a claim about how persons, ideals, organizations and actions necessarily relate, and about what makes their relating come to good. You check yourself against it and find which relation has failed.",
      "id": "289934e1cd16efcb"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "Examples: [[The Two Governing Models]], the Optimum Sequence, [[AIC]].",
      "id": "3c743c718bb86453"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "## Diagnostic",
      "id": "9d2493a5c81ee0ad"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "What to do when you are stuck. A routing procedure that takes an unclear situation and returns a type, a scale, and a decision about which production sequence to enter. The kind people most need and the kind least often written down.",
      "id": "794f47d6e702a6ce"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "Examples: [[Systemic Problem Solving]], [[Cynefin]], [[The Six Nested Questions]], [[Six Thinking Hats]], [[DSRP]].",
      "id": "ef8fc4b87076e643"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "## Production",
      "id": "e5f74d37821e0aa4"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "Getting a thing built, delivered and taught. Ordered work with resources, handoffs and deliverables. These look like conventional method documentation and are the least transferable, each being fitted to a domain.",
      "id": "b4b16ce744db7288"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "Examples: [[15 Ps]], [[Another Sequence of Tools]], [[Vester's Sensitivity Model]], the System Discovery Process.",
      "id": "d99bdb7fb7b4d8af"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "## Curricular",
      "id": "bc9a22586f1f0943"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "The order in which a person learns the skills. A learning progression is not a work progression: causal loop diagramming, then stock flow, then system dynamics, then Vester is how you acquire the practice, and nobody would run a project in that order. This is the kind [[SODOTO]] actually certifies.",
      "id": "f2e8e67b6d3737b2"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "Examples: the six pathways already named in the SODOTO Skills Registry, and the four levels of the [[Systems Curriculum]].",
      "id": "ff8058a8aeb3d5ad"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "## How they connect",
      "id": "e7caa745400f911c"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "All four are patterns in Alexander's sense, at different scales. The diagnostic pathway selects a production pathway. The curricular pathways say who is qualified to run either. The ontological frame is what all of it is checked against.",
      "id": "71e4172733f82971"
    }
  ],
